# Kokoro-FastAPI for TTS, with the KOKORO_FASTAPI shim (voices listed from /audio/voices); STT stays on the stack's
# Speaches. Free, local, on the GPU.
# Engine: docker compose -f tests/ha_e2e/smoke/docker-compose.engines.yml --profile kokoro-fastapi up -d --wait kokoro
# Serves: TTS over HTTP, sentence by sentence. STT stays on the stack's Speaches.
# Backend: KOKORO_FASTAPI for TTS.
TTS_OPENAI_URL=http://kokoro:8880/v1
TTS_MODELS=kokoro
TTS_STREAMING_MODELS=kokoro
TTS_REALTIME_MODELS=
TTS_BACKEND=KOKORO_FASTAPI
TTS_VOICES=
